  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid to Drought &amp; Conflict Affected People Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide an emergency aid to internally displaced persons (IDPS) who have been displaced from Wolega and are currently taking refuge in DebreBirhan &amp;  Drought affected people in Wag Himra Zone in Amhara and  Borena in Oromia Region. Without recovering from the damage caused by the war in Northern Ethiopia, unfortunately there are more than 37,000 Internally Displaced Persons (IDPS) in need of assistance in Debre Birhan who have not received any humanitarian assistance yet.</narrative>
  </description>
